    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">section</span>&gt;</span>
      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h2</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"section-title"</span>&gt;</span>ImanI American Holiday Boycott Celebration[cite: 1]<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h2</span>&gt;</span>
      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"doctrine-card"</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-main);"</span>&gt;</span>
          The <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>ImanI American Holiday Boycott Celebration<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> is a <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>3 + 1 + 3 = 7-day economic fast<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> observed during every Federal Holiday. 
          This isn't a protest—it is a <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>celebration<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>. A <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">em</span>&gt;</span>Silent Solution Quiet Movement<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">em</span>&gt;</span> embodying <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>Unity in Motion<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>, where we practice total economic self-reliance, quiet reflection, and community sovereignty.
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"grid-3col"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top: 8px;"</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-card"</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">span</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-num"</span>&gt;</span>The Formula<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">span</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h4</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-title"</span>&gt;</span>3 + 1 + 3 = 7 Days<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h4</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-desc"</span>&gt;</span>Three days of preparation and pause before the holiday, one sacred day of sovereign reflection on the holiday, and three days of continued economic focus following it.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-card"</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">span</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-num"</span>&gt;</span>The Purpose<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">span</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h4</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-title"</span>&gt;</span>Silent Solution Quiet Movement<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h4</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-desc"</span>&gt;</span>Not a public demonstration or street protest, but a silent economic fast that preserves value, builds self-reliance, and honors our heritage from within.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-card"</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">span</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-num"</span>&gt;</span>The Spirit<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">span</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h4</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-title"</span>&gt;</span>Unity in Motion<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h4</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"pillar-desc"</span>&gt;</span>Circulating resources in our own circles, stepping off external commercial tracks, and celebrating the resilience, beauty, and independence of our people.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
