603972="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c1708603972-89" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1708603972="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c1708603972-89"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1708603972-89"><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c3439656023="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false"><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h2><!----><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c912621556="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" _nghost-ng-c3228108065="" id="message-content-id-r_5c81e6510b8b1a00" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3228108065="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_5c81e6510b8b1a00" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">Here are practical, high-impact suggestions tailored specifically to elevate the portal’s usability, live broadcast experience, community engagement, and visual storytelling:</p><p data-path-to-node="1"><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="0">Live Stage &amp; Broadcast Enhancements</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Dynamic Stream Status Polling:</b> Add a lightweight heartbeat function in JavaScript to check if your MediaMTX HLS stream URL is live every 10–15 seconds, automatically transitioning the stage from the standby loop to live video when you start broadcasting without needing to press "Connect Stream."</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Audio Mute/Unmute Toggle on Standby:</b> Give viewers a sleek on-screen audio unmute/volume icon directly over the standby video stage so they can choose to listen to the <i data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="167">Unity in Motion</i> music loop while browsing the page.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Stage Chat &amp; Community Feed:</b> Embed an OBS-compatible live chat window or a lightweight WebSockets comment board alongside the stage to allow viewers to interact with you in real time during DJ sessions.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">Interactive Learning &amp; Doctrine Utility</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Audio Narration for Doctrine Cards:</b> Add a subtle "Listen" icon next to the Ten Mysteries, Origin &amp; Revelation, and Operational Code revelation boxes to play Chatty’s voice reciting the selected principle.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Search / Keyword Filter for the 99 Wisdom Cards:</b> Add a quick search bar or category tag filter (e.g., <i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="102">Strategy</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="112">Economics</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="123">Stealth</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="132">Lineage</i>) to Chatty’s Wisdom Deck so visitors can draw cards by specific life themes.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Holiday Economic Fast Calendar Integration:</b> Expand the countdown banner into an interactive Federal Holiday schedule showing the exact 3 + 1 + 3 dates for the upcoming year, with a "Download to Calendar" (.ics) button for the community.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Visual &amp; Performance Optimization</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Persistent Media Lightbox:</b> Enable a full-screen image/video lightbox popup when a user clicks on any card in the Picture Galleries or Cinematic Vault.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Progressive Web App (PWA) Offline Support:</b> Add a simple <code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="56">manifest.json</code> and service worker so supporters can install the website directly onto their phones and tablets as a standalone app, storing the wisdom cards and doctrine offline.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="7">Which of these would you like to explore or implement next into the portal?</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c3453717024="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c2059050657="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div>