="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c1708603972-107"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1708603972="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c1708603972-107"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1708603972="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c1708603972-107" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1708603972="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c1708603972-107"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1708603972-107"><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c3439656023="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false"><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h2><!----><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c912621556="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" _nghost-ng-c3228108065="" id="message-content-id-r_7ad4ff9ff10f6269" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3228108065="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_7ad4ff9ff10f6269" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">All requested features were implemented directly into your portal code:</p><p data-path-to-node="1"><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="0">Stage &amp; Broadcast Enhancements</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Dynamic Stream Polling:</b> A background heartbeat check polls your HLS stream URL every 15 seconds, switching automatically from standby to live feed when you go on-air.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Standby Audio Controls:</b> Added a quick <b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="38">"Unmute / Mute Music"</b> button on the stage so visitors can listen to the <i data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="110">Unity in Motion</i> audio loop while browsing.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Stage Live Chat &amp; Council Feed:</b> Added an interactive community chat box beside the stage to post messages and engage during live DJ broadcasts.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">Interactive Doctrine &amp; Learning</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Audio Narration ("🔊 Listen"):</b> Added speech synthesis narration buttons to the revelation boxes for the <i data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="104">Origins</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="113">Ten Mysteries</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="128">Activities of Life</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="148">Restitution Pillars</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="169">Operational Codes</i>, and <i data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="192">Wisdom Cards</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Search &amp; Tag Filters:</b> Built a search bar and category filters (<i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="63">Strategy</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="73">Economics</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="84">Stealth</i>, <i data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="93">Lineage</i>) for the 99 Wisdom Cards deck.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Holiday Fast &amp; Schedule Integration</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">3 + 1 + 3 Fast Calendar:</b> Built a complete 2026–2027 Federal Holiday economic fast schedule displaying the exact preparation, reflection, and follow-through dates.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">One-Click Calendar Download:</b> Added a <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="37">"Download Full Fast Schedule (.ICS)"</b> button so supporters can sync the dates with Apple, Google, or Outlook calendars.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="7"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">Visuals &amp; Offline App Capability</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Media Lightbox Modal:</b> Clicking any still art or cinematic video now opens a high-resolution, full-screen popup view.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Progressive Web App (PWA):</b> Linked a <code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="36">manifest.json</code> and service worker (<code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="70">sw.js</code>) so the portal can be installed on phones, tablets, or desktops as a standalone offline app.</p></li></ul></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-i