en Uploads (No Coding Required)</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0" id="p-rc_6e6d0920873f3b3c-40"><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Still Pictures &amp; Posters:</b> Click directly on any picture frame in the <b data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="69">Holiday Boycott Gallery</b>, <b data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="94">Still Art &amp; Lore Gallery</b>, or <b data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="123">Chatty’s Wisdom Frame</b></span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,2">. The hidden file selector will open, allowing you to choose an image from your computer</span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,3"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---