s; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" id="p-rc_6c3df4c0c7347b61-50"><span data-path-to-node="0,0">To connect your <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="16">media/</code> folder cleanly to <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="41">index.html</code></span><span data-path-to-node="0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2">, update the file paths so the browser points directly to your subfolders (e.g., <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="81">media/audio/</code> and <code data-path-to-node="0,2" data-index-in-node="98">media/video/</code>).</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3062569485="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3062569485="" _nghost-ng-c1826364007="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from HTML: Index.html. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="fal