        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);"</span>&gt;</span>
          Synchronize your economic pauses across the year. The 3 + 1 + 3 formula frames 7 complete days of self-reliance for every federal observance.
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
        
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"holiday-table-wrap"</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">table</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"holiday-table"</span>&gt;</span>
            <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">thead</span>&gt;</span>
              <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">tr</span>&gt;</span>
                <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">th</span>&gt;</span>Federal Holiday<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">th</span>&gt;</span>
                <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">th</span>&gt;</span>Holiday Date<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">th</span>&gt;</span>
