<!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3062569485="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3062569485="" _nghost-ng-c1826364007="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from HTML: Index.html. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">HTML</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="12"><b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">Quick Built-In Upload Feature</b></p><p data-path-to-node="13">If you don't want to rename or move all your files right now, you can load them directly on the screen:</p><ul data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0" id="p-rc_1961c1e7ae05974c-190"><span data-path-to-node="14,0,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">For Artwork / Pictures:</b> Click on any empty picture frame or emblem box on the page</span><span data-path-to-node="14,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---