 </h2><!----><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c912621556="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" _nghost-ng-c3228108065="" id="message-content-id-r_dfb9be333124ea9b" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3228108065="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_dfb9be333124ea9b" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" id="p-rc_117d5d55761c89af-201"><span data-path-to-node="0,0">The reason those spots are showing empty boxes with text titles is because the HTML code is using <b data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="98">placeholder file names</b> (like <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="127">track1.mp3</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="139">grand-awakening.mp4</code>, and <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="164">header-emblem.png</code>)</span><span data-path-to-node="0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!-