];
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"><b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0">3. Automatic Playlist &amp; Video Vault Rendering</b></p><p data-path-to-node="11">When the page loads, the script automatically reads that list, creates the playlist items, adds category filters (e.g., clicking <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="129">"ImanI Story"</b> or <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="146">"The Mysteries"</b> only shows those tracks), and hooks up the audio player.</p><p data-path-to-node="12" id="p-rc_f085beaf7e00258c-209"><span data-path-to-node="12,0">Would you like me to update <code data-path-to-node="12,0" data-index-in-node="28">index.html</code></span><span data-path-to-node="12,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="12,2"> with this dynamic, category-based Media Library system so you can manage your files easily by series and folders?</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3062569485="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3062569485="" _nghost-ng-c1826364007="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from HTML: Index.html. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">HTML</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c3453717024="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c2059050657="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!-