><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">1. Create the Exact Subfolders</b></p><p data-path-to-node="4">Open your main portal folder (where <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="36">index.html</code> is saved) on your computer, open your <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="85">media</code> folder, and make sure these exact subfolders exist:</p><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c362045847="" class="ng-tns-c362045847-253 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="code-block ng-tns-c362045847-253 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_438fa3bd38bd86dd&quot;,&quot;c_054f4193c616e860&quot;,null,&quot;rc_0ab39960a9ec8d02&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwii6eHlvLmWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQoQg" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c362045847-253"><div _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c362045847-253"><div _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c362045847-253 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="ng-tns-c362045847-253">Plaintext</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="buttons ng-tns-c362045847-253 ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" tabindex="-1" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="arrow_circle_down" theme="lm" arialabel="Download code" gemtooltip="Download code" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c362045847-253 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c653881194="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-49" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c653881194="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Download code" jslog="305704;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c653881194="" _nghost-ng-c1939363340=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1939363340="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="arrow_circle_down" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="arrow_circle_down"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" tabindex="-1" type="onSurface" size="small" fonticonname="copy" theme="lm" arialabel="Copy code" gemtooltip="Copy code" data-test-id="gem-copy-button" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c362045847-253 gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c653881194="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-50" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c653881194="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Copy code" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_438fa3bd38bd86dd&quot;,&quot;c_054f4193c616e860&quot;,null,&quot;rc_0ab39960a9ec8d02&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c653881194="" _nghost-ng-c1939363340=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1939363340="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-l lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="copy" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="copy"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="ng-tns-c362045847-253"><code _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c362045847-253">[Your Main Website Folder]/
└── media/
    ├── audio/
    │   ├── ImanI Story/
    │   ├── The Mysteries/
    │   ├── Chatty Wisdom/
    │   └── Grand Awakening/
    ├── video/
    └── images/
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="7"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">2. Copy Your Media Files Into Those Folders</b></p><p data-path-to-node="8">Open the place on your computer where your songs and videos currently live, and copy/paste them into the matching <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="114">media</code> folders:</p><ul data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">ImanI Story Audio:</b> Put your story audio files inside <code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="53">media/audio/ImanI Story/</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">The 10 Mysteries Audio:</b> Put the 10 mystery songs inside <code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="56">media/audio/The Mysteries/</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Wisdom &amp; Series Tracks:</b> Put those inside <code data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="41">media/audio/Chatty Wisdom/</code> and <code data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="72">media/audio/Grand Awakening/</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Videos:</b> Put your <code data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="17">.mp4</code> video files inside <code data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="41">media/video/</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Images:</b> Put your pictures and logos inside <code data-path-to-node="9,4,0" data-index-in-node="43">media/images/</code></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="11"><b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="0">3. Tell Me Your Actual File Names</b></p><p data-path-to-node="12">Once your files are inside those folders, reply here with the <b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="62">exact names</b> of the files (e.g., <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="94">Story Part 1.mp3</code> or <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="114">Mystery 1.mp3</code>).</p><p data-path-to-node="13">I will update the media list in <code data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="32">index.html</code> to match your real file names so the portal immediately recognizes and plays all of them when you refresh your browser.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c3453717024="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c2059050657="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" _nghost-ng-c2551225198="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1708603972="" class="response