er" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false"><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h2><!----><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2984337282="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c912621556="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c912621556="" _nghost-ng-c3228108065="" id="message-content-id-r_a30c4bbdf413fe4c" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3228108065="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering" id="model-response-message-contentr_a30c4bbdf413fe4c" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0" id="p-rc_fbd08578cb608ee9-218"><span data-path-to-node="0,0">When you pick files with a file-picker button (<code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="47">&lt;input type="file"&gt;</code>), web browsers generate temporary local blob URLs (e.g., <code data-path-to-node="0,0" data-index-in-node="124">blob:http://...</code>) in computer memory for security</span><span data-path-to-node="0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,2">. The instant you refresh, close the tab, or exit the browser, the browser deletes those memory links</span><span data-path-to-node="0,3"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="0,4">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3062569485="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3062569485="" _nghost-ng-c1826364007="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citations from HTML: Index.html and HTML: Index.html. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">HTML</span><span _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-count ng-star-inserted">+ 1</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="1">Here is why this happens and how to make your tracks stay permanently:</p><p data-path-to-node="2"><b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0">Why Temporary Uploads Disappear</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0" id="p-rc_fbd08578cb608ee9-219"><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Browser Security Sandbox:</b> Browsers do not grant webpages permanent silent read access to your local hard drive paths across different sessions unless files are referenced directly in the project directory</span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,2">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3062569485="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3062569485="" _nghost-ng-c1826364007="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from HTML: Index.html. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">HTML</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Storage Limits:</b> Unlike small text or images, large audio files cannot reliably be saved into standard browser local storage (<code data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="125">localStorage</code>).</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">The Permanent Solution: Listing Your File Paths in the Code</b></p><p data-path-to-node="6" id="p-rc_fbd08578cb608ee9-220"><span data-path-to-node="6,0">To have your songs load automatically every time anyone opens or refreshes the site, list the actual filenames in the <code data-path-to-node="6,0" data-index-in-node="118">myAudioLibrary</code> list inside <code data-path-to-node="6,0" data-index-in-node="145">index.html</code></span><span data-path-to-node="6,1"><span><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c2282120608="" class="ng-star-inserted"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2282120608="" class="superscript"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node="6,2">:</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c3062569485="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3062569485="" _nghost-ng-c1826364007="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from HTML: Index.html. Press Enter to open sources dialog." aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1826364007="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">HTML</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c362045847="" class="ng-tns-c362045847-292 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c362045847="" class="code-block ng-tns-c362045847-292 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBl