    <span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!-- 7. Holiday Boycott Celebration --&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">section</span>&gt;</span>
      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h2</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"section-title"</span>&gt;</span>ImanI American Holiday Boycott Celebration[cite: 1]<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h2</span>&gt;</span>
      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"doctrine-card"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-bottom: 20px; border-left: 4px solid var(--gold-accent);"</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--gold-accent); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;"</span>&gt;</span>
          ⚡ Break the chains of commercialized tradition — Reclaim your power!
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.7;"</span>&gt;</span>
          American Holidays were <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>never designed with us in mind<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>, and we never had a voice in their creation! Whenever we forged our own sacred moments, they outlawed our celebrations only to repackage and sell them back to us as empty consumerism. We dishonor our own divine dignity when we finance and celebrate the rituals of our oppression. <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>The era of blind compliance is over!<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> Rise up, stand tall in sovereign majesty, and boldly <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>SAY NO to American holidays<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> — ignite your spirit and celebrate true independence!
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>

      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"button-matrix"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"boycott-buttons"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"revelation-box"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"boycott-display"</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"rev-header-wrap"</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"rev-tag"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"boycott-tag"</span>&gt;</span>Economic Fast[cite: 1]<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"rev-title"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"boycott-title"</span>&gt;</span>3 + 1 + 3 = 7-Day Economic Fast<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
          <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">button</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"btn-audio-narrate"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">onclick</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"narrateText('boycott-title', 'boycott-desc')"</span>&gt;</span>🔊 Listen<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">button</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">class</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"rev-content"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">id</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"boycott-desc"</span>&gt;</span>Observed every Federal Holiday: three days of strategic pause before the holiday, one sacred day of sovereign reflection on the holiday, and three days of continued economic discipline following it.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span>
      <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span>
    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">section</span>&gt;</span>

