="4"><b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="0">1. Save the Audio Files from Chat to Your Computer</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0">Click the download / save button on each audio file you shared here in our chat.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">2. Move Them into Your Mysteries Folder</b>
