Make sure the filenames inside <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="74">media/audio/The mysteries/</code> match these names character-for-character:</p><ul data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">10_mysteries_of_imani_jan_24_2026_1_18_30_pm2.wav</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Mysteries of ImanI.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,2,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Cycle of ImanI male.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,3,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">Mystery 1 Cycle of ImanI Female.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,4,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Mystery 1 Cycle of ImanI male.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,5,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">mystery 2 the mirror that doesn't lie.wav</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,6,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,6,0" data-index-in-node="0">mystery 3 Between the Pillars.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,7,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,7,0" data-index-in-node="0">mystery 4 Solar and Lunar Power.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,8,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,8,0" data-index-in-node="0">Mystery 5 I and I, Essence and Unity.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,9,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,9,0" data-index-in-node="0">Mystery 6 I M is I Am.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,10,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,10,0" data-index-in-node="0">Mystery 7 I M Ani I M Beautiful.mp3</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,11,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,11,0" data-index-in-node="0">mystery 8 The Iniciation The Scraed Circle.wav</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,12,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,12,0" data-index-in-node="0">Cycle of ImanI male_2.mp3</code></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="11"><b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="0">4. Refresh Your Browser</b>
